      "The tool license reassignment exception record should name the condition, the decision, the releaser, and the time the dependent action resumed. Use the same definition across the queue and the review so the counts agree. When access blocks the work, name the system, role, and approver. Separate a data conflict from a policy conflict. An escalation that ends in silence remains open. The tool license reassignment case note should show what the license admin held at the time and who reviewed it.",
