      "## Review the pattern, not only the case",
      "A useful tool license reassignment review ends with one testable change, one owner, and a date to measure whether the change moved the result. Report a null result as clearly as a positive one. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. Separate what was observed from what the team believes caused it. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. The tool license reassignment reviewer records confirmation, the owner, and the next action in one place.",
